            <ArticleTitle>[Cervical syndromes and cervical spondylosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The painful cervical syndromes are frequently due to arthrosis. After a complete enumeration of the many clinical syndromes, the Author analyse some conditions, from the functional anatomy point of view, of the cervical spine, responsible for the various clinical manifestations of the cervical syndromes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
